{{!-- Role, and the two facts the Marketplace gives someone the party pays. Name is NOT here — it is
      typed on the sheet, and a field editable in two places is two sources of truth one save
      apart. Background, Traits and the d20 fields are on this window's Details tab. --}}
<section class="tab cairn-edit-panel {{tab.cssClass}}" data-group="primary" data-tab="general">
    {{!-- Role is a row of ink buttons, the segmented control every other short closed range on
          an item sheet uses — a native select is the one control this design has no primitive for.
          The label beside a group cannot be a `<label for>` (a group is not one control), so the
          row's word is a span and the group carries its own `aria-label`, as the gear sheet's
          Damage row does. --}}
    <div class="cairn-field">
        <span class="cairn-field-label">{{localize 'CAIRN.Role.Label'}}</span>
        <div class="cairn-choice" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{localize 'CAIRN.Role.Label'}}">
            {{#each roleOptions as |opt|}}
            <label class="cairn-choice-option">
                <input type="radio" name="system.role" value="{{opt.value}}" {{checked opt.selected}} />
                <span>{{localize opt.label}}</span>
            </label>
            {{/each}}
        </div>
    </div>
    {{!-- Shown for every person, whatever the role (`marketplace.md` § Hirelings per day). Filling
          a Career is what makes someone a paid hand on the face of the sheet — the header prints
          the trade and price whenever there is one — so the field cannot be behind the role that
          the Warden may not have set yet.

          The Career die fills this row AND the rate under it: the Marketplace fixes the rate to
          the trade, so the two are one roll. --}}
    <div class="cairn-field cairn-die-row">
        <label for="cairn-edit-career">{{localize 'CAIRN.Career'}}</label>
        <input id="cairn-edit-career" type="text" name="system.career" value="{{system.career}}" autofocus />
        <button type="button" class="mini" data-action="rollDetail" data-key="career"
            data-tooltip="{{localize 'CAIRN.RollField'}}"><i class="fas fa-dice-d20"></i></button>
    </div>
    <div class="cairn-field cairn-unit-row">
        <label for="cairn-edit-dayrate">{{localize 'CAIRN.DayRate'}}</label>
        <input id="cairn-edit-dayrate" class="cairn-edit-digits" type="number" name="system.dayRate"
            value="{{system.dayRate}}" min="0" step="1" />
        <span class="cairn-field-unit">{{localize 'CAIRN.Edit.RateUnit'}}</span>
    </div>
</section>
